  "body": "Adds a Contributing section to README.md, summarising AGENTS.md's Issue Law and Commits and Releases for contributors and agents:\n- tools: git, gh (gh-issues skill), graphify, scripts/gate.ps1, the shared .claude agents/skills;\n- issues: priorities, labels (incl. source:agent), claiming, reporting, finishing as a PR (in-review);\n- branches/PRs: branching from latest main, conventional commits and breaking changes, PR body (Changelog: line, Fixes #N), no CHANGELOG.md edits, local quick gate, the engineering rules;\n- review and merge: main's protection, the reviewer agent (comment-only, untrusted-input handling), manual approval and merge by the maintainer, fork workflow approval, how release cuts and semver work.\n\nAlso fixes two stale lines: CI no longer runs on push, and ROADMAP.md is a frozen archive.\n\nChangelog: none (docs only)",
